aerographene: nome de produto e diretório de dados próprios.

Origem: aerographene (original; abordagem do BRANDING como em
helium/core/change-chromium-branding.patch do Helium 0.18.3). Licença: GPL-3.0.
Propósito: `--version`, títulos e metadados usam "aerographene" em vez de
"Chromium" (PRODUCT_FULLNAME etc. viram version.h/version_info); o perfil
padrão vai para ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/aerographene (cache em
~/.cache/aerographene), sem colidir com um Chromium instalado. Strings da UI
em chromium_strings.grd continuam dizendo "Chromium" (fora do escopo).

--- a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
+++ b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
-COMPANY_FULLNAME=The Chromium Authors
-COMPANY_SHORTNAME=The Chromium Authors
-PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Chromium
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Chromium Installer
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Chromium Installer
-COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The Chromium Authors. All rights reserved.
-MAC_BUNDLE_ID=org.chromium.Chromium
+COMPANY_FULLNAME=The aerographene Authors
+COMPANY_SHORTNAME=The aerographene Authors
+PRODUCT_FULLNAME=aerographene
+PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=aerographene
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=aerographene Installer
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=aerographene Installer
+COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The aerographene Authors. All rights reserved.
+MAC_BUNDLE_ID=org.aerographene.aerographene
 MAC_CREATOR_CODE=Cr24
 MAC_TEAM_ID=
--- a/chrome/common/chrome_paths_linux.cc
+++ b/chrome/common/chrome_paths_linux.cc
@@ -95,7 +95,8 @@
 #elif BUILDFLAG(GOOGLE_CHROME_BRANDING)
   std::string data_dir_basename = "google-chrome";
 #else
-  std::string data_dir_basename = "chromium";
+  // aerographene: own user-data dir, so it never clashes with Chromium.
+  std::string data_dir_basename = "aerographene";
 #endif
   *result = config_dir.Append(data_dir_basename + GetChannelSuffixForDataDir());
   return true;
